n the Heart","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2019-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"So let me get this straight— you don’t do drugs, but you’ll have sex with women you’re not married to…? That’s not nuanced, you’re a hypocrite.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kMCCGACS4YHgq8hEANFeRvJfOIK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmFteS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOS0lMjkv.1.4","title":"Strawberries","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2019-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Everyone’s suspicious, man. Maybe your family was in on it, maybe not. Just lay low, and don’t draw attention to yourself. It’ll all die down… maybe. Also, where are all your Mom’s magazines?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rpgtSXkNCquhSfEa81JQkp1t7Jb.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmFteS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOS0lMjkv.1.5","title":"Do the Ramadan","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2019-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Time for a spiritual cleanse. Get this month right, and you’ll have it all figured out. Fast properly, read your Quran, no sex, no porn… bro, close the MacBook! No porn. Just do the Ramadan. Get your life on track.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dBOQrCuwgjfyk5v5JpvbtFyx4Kt.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmFteS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOS0lMjkv.1.6","title":"Refugees","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2019-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"So you’re doing all this soul searching… dope. What about your sister? Can she? Yeah? How can she find herself if she’s gotta be home by ten? What do you think she– Ramy, where are you going?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbhdpmfjjS1l7lK2CSwEFhJjfCD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmFteS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOS0lMjkv.1.7","title":"Ne Me Quitte Pas","season":1,"episode":7,"re